Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.17,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}I'm 71,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.20,0:00:02.60,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}and I take the\Nstairs faster
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.60,0:00:04.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}than women\Nhalf my age.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.30,0:00:05.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}Last Sunday,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.34,0:00:06.50,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}my daughter\Nwalked behind me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.50,0:00:07.86,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}the whole way\Nup and said,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.86,0:00:09.46,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}"Mama,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.46,0:00:10.79,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}when did that happen?"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.20,0:00:12.36,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}Six weeks ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.36,0:00:13.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}I was going down
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.06,0:00:14.37,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}my stairs backwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.70,0:00:16.01,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}One step at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.42,0:00:17.33,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}I ain't gonna lie,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.46,0:00:18.42,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}some days I\Nwasn't going
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.42,0:00:19.20,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}down them at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.20,0:00:20.89,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}I'd just stay\Nupstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.26,0:00:22.48,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}That big knee\Nbrace I bought
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.48,0:00:24.23,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}slid right\Ndown my leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.28,0:00:25.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}By evening,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.12,0:00:26.14,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}it was around\Nmy ankle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.14,0:00:28.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}I done tried\Neverything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.56,0:00:29.75,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}Physical therapy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.94,0:00:30.79,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}Pain pills.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.82,0:00:32.01,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}Cortisone shots.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.10,0:00:34.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}Every brace and\Nsleeve they make.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.38,0:00:35.41,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}Nothing worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.50,0:00:36.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}Nothing lasted.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.90,0:00:38.69,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}Nothing gave me\Nmy life back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.98,0:00:40.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}Then my grandbaby got
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.30,0:00:41.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}married in June.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.54,0:00:42.89,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}My cousin Loretta\Nwas there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.00,0:00:44.19,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}She's 74,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.38,0:00:45.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}and she was out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.04,0:00:47.03,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}on that dance\Nfloor all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.28,0:00:48.34,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}Electric Slide,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.34,0:00:49.29,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}Cupid Shuffle,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.38,0:00:50.13,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.28,0:00:50.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}Both her knees
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.84,0:00:52.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}was bone on bone too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.62,0:00:54.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}I always figured\Nhers wasn't
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.00,0:00:54.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}as bad as mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.80,0:00:56.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}I always figured mine
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.26,0:00:57.45,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}was past fixing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.84,0:00:58.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}Loretta came to stay
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.66,0:00:59.61,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}the week after.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.76,0:01:00.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}She watched me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.40,0:01:01.18,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}at the kitchen table,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.18,0:01:02.73,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}going through my\Nmorning routine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.16,0:01:04.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}Two\Nanti-inflammatories,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.68,0:01:05.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}the gel,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.40,0:01:05.76,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}the brace,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.76,0:01:06.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}an ice pack
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.62,0:01:07.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}on my right knee.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.98,0:01:09.35,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}After a minute\Nshe said,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.56,0:01:10.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}"Baby,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.16,0:01:11.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}can I show you\Nsomething?"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.52,0:01:12.95,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}She pulled up\Nher pant leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.08,0:01:13.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}She had on
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.58,0:01:14.56,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}a little black strap,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.56,0:01:16.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}right under\Nher kneecap.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.30,0:01:17.24,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}Stryde.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.24,0:01:18.37,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}She handed me one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.62,0:01:19.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}It looked ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.14,0:01:20.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}Too small.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.84,0:01:21.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}I said,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.84,0:01:22.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}"Loretta,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.38,0:01:23.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}you know good and well
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.22,0:01:23.96,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}this ain't gonna work
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.96,0:01:25.17,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}on knees like mine."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.36,0:01:26.07,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}She said,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.16,0:01:26.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}"Just put it on
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.84,0:01:28.33,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}and walk down\Nthem stairs."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.70,0:01:29.18,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.18,0:01:30.60,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}Chile,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.60,0:01:31.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}the first step,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.68,0:01:32.32,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}I didn't even have
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.32,0:01:33.33,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}to hold the rail.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.58,0:01:34.47,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}Not the second.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.54,0:01:35.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}Not the third.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.74,0:01:37.07,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}All the way down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.08,0:01:37.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}Both feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.06,0:01:38.79,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}Forwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.08,0:01:39.95,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}She said,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.06,0:01:41.24,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}"Everything\Nelse you tried
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.24,0:01:42.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}was made to keep you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.16,0:01:44.07,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}comfortable while\Nyour knee got worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.38,0:01:46.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}This one fixes\Nwhy it hurts."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.28,0:01:47.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}She said,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.64,0:01:48.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}"There's one\Nspot under
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.66,0:01:50.83,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}the kneecap where\Nevery step lands."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.18,0:01:52.03,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}"Every brace,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.12,0:01:52.90,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}every shot,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.90,0:01:54.32,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}every pill\Nyou ever tried
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.32,0:01:55.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}treated the\Nwhole knee.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.84,0:01:56.75,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}Not that spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.96,0:01:58.41,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}That's why ain't\Nnothing worked."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.70,0:02:00.13,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}"The pain is pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.20,0:02:01.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}That's all it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.46,0:02:02.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}This strap\Nsits right on
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.74,0:02:04.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}that spot and takes\Nthe weight off."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.86,0:02:05.73,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}First step.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.92,0:02:06.73,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}Pain gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.94,0:02:07.89,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}Just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.12,0:02:10.81,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}Over 200,000 people\Nwear one now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.00,0:02:12.10,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}Sports doctors\Nrecommend it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.10,0:02:13.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}Not the pharma\Ncompanies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.66,0:02:14.64,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}Sports doctors.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.64,0:02:16.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}Loretta's husband\Nwears one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.62,0:02:17.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}He's 76,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.38,0:02:18.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}and he plays golf
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.26,0:02:19.39,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}twice a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.54,0:02:20.32,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}Her niece wears one
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.32,0:02:21.41,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}when she runs track.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.54,0:02:22.43,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}She's 22.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.76,0:02:23.90,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}I've worn mine every
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.90,0:02:25.33,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}day for six weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.44,0:02:26.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}Under my clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.34,0:02:27.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}Don't nobody\Nknow it's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.82,0:02:28.51,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}No pills.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.62,0:02:29.29,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}No gel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.54,0:02:30.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}No brace around
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.22,0:02:31.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}my ankle by lunchtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.14,0:02:34.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}Yesterday I walked\Nto the store.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.48,0:02:35.41,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}Two miles there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.54,0:02:36.36,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}Two miles back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.36,0:02:38.76,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}Passed three\Nwomen half my age.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.76,0:02:40.82,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}Stood in that\Ncheckout line ten
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.82,0:02:42.63,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}minutes without\Nshifting my weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.90,0:02:44.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}Carried two bags home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.08,0:02:46.07,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}Didn't nobody help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.44,0:02:47.24,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}When I got home,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.24,0:02:48.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}my husband said,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.54,0:02:49.89,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}"You was gone\Na long time."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.08,0:02:50.75,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}I said,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.96,0:02:51.56,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}"I know."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.86,0:02:52.92,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}That was six weeks
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.92,0:02:54.01,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}of wearing the strap.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.20,0:02:55.07,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}Nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.32,0:02:57.12,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}Three ladies from\Nchurch already ordered
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.12,0:02:58.32,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}one after they\Nwatched me come
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.32,0:02:59.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}down the church steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.70,0:03:00.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}So I'ma just say
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.54,0:03:01.43,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}it right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.66,0:03:04.43,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}It's called Stryde\NPatellar Force Redirection.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.58,0:03:06.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}They spent three\Nyears designing
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.30,0:03:07.83,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}it with orthopedic\Nsurgeons.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.00,0:03:09.29,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}It's the real thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.48,0:03:10.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}Not them cheap\Nknock-offs they
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.84,0:03:11.76,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}be selling on Amazon
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.76,0:03:13.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}and them fake\Nwebsites.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.38,0:03:15.03,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}The link's right\Ndown below.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.26,0:03:16.32,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}Two straps\Nfor the price
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.32,0:03:17.46,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}of one right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.46,0:03:18.76,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}Sixty days to send
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.76,0:03:19.90,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}them back if\Nthey don't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.90,0:03:22.19,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}Eleven years\Nof knee pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.40,0:03:23.50,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}Gone the first step
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.50,0:03:24.69,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}I took with it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.98,0:03:25.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}I bought my sister
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.72,0:03:27.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}a pair that same week.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.16,0:03:28.17,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}She coming Sunday.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.42,0:03:29.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}She gon' walk up
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.22,0:03:30.85,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1382)}my stairs on her own.
